 for the program\n   - Potential scholarships or grants available\n\n2. **For specific fee information**:\n   - Contact Walden University directly\n   - Visit their official website for up-to-date details\n\nFeel free to ask if you have any more questions!', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={})]' for
