 for the program\n   - Potential scholarships or grants available\n\n2. **For specific fee information**:\n   - Contact Walden University directly\n   - Visit their official website for up-to-date details\n\nFeel free to ask if you have any more questions!', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), HumanMessage(content='I need the fees structure', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), AIMessage(content="### Fees Structure for Walden University's Bachelor of Science in Business Administration Program\n\n- The fees for the Bachelor of Science in Business Administration program at Walden University may vary based on:\n  1. Number of credits required for the program\n  2. Potential scholarships or grants available\n\n- For specific fee information, it is recommended to:\n  1. Contact Walden University directly\n  2. Visit the official website for up-to-date details\n\nIf you have any more questions or need further assistance, feel free to ask!", additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), HumanMessage(content='who are the faculties', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), AIMessage(content='### Walden University Faculty Members\n\n- **Gail Miles**\n  - Program Director\n  - Extensive experience in Computer Science\n\n- **Osama Morad**\n  - Contributing Faculty member in the College of Management and Human Potential\n  - Holds a Doctor of Information Technology (DIT) degree\n\nOur faculty members bring diverse industry expertise and a passion for teaching to the Walden community. If you have any more questions about our faculty, feel free to ask!', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), HumanMessage(content='Hey, I’m looking for an online university. Do you guys offer fully online degrees?', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), AIMessage(content="### Fully Online Degrees at Walden University\n\n- Walden University offers fully online degrees in various fields such as:\n  1. Data Science\n  2. Cybersecurity\n  3. Criminal Justice\n\n- These programs are designed to provide flexibility for students to study from anywhere with an internet connection.\n\n- Whether you're looking to advance your career or pursue a new field, Walden's online programs can help you achieve your goals.\n\nIf you have any specific program in mind or need more information, feel free to ask!", additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), HumanMessage(content='any bs program', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), AIMessage(content="### Bachelor's Degree Programs at Walden University\n\n- Walden University offers a range of bachelor's degree programs in various fields, including:\n  1. Bachelor of Science in Business Administration\n  2. Bachelor of Science in Criminal Justice\n  3. Bachelor of Science in Nursing\n  4. Bachelor of Science in Psychology\n\n- These programs are designed to be completed fully online, providing flexibility for students to balance their studies with other commitments.\n\n- If you have a specific bachelor's program in mind or need more information about the available options, feel free to ask for more details!\n\nWe are here to help with any questions you may have about our bachelor's programs!", additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), HumanMessage(content='any more bs program', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), AIMessage(content="### Additional Bachelor's Degree Programs at Walden University\n\n- Bachelor of Science in Health Studies\n- Bachelor of Science in Public Health\n- Bachelor of Science in Information Technology\n- Bachelor of Science in Human Services\n\nThese programs are designed to be completed fully online, providing students with the flexibility to pursue their education while balancing other commitments. If you are interested in any specific bachelor's program or need more information about the available options, feel free to ask for more details! \n\nFeel free to ask if you have any more questions!", additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={})]' for
