reduction of $19,250\n\n4. **Total Cost**\n   - After scholarship: $46,980\n\n5. **Additional Costs**\n   - Books and materials not included\n   - Additional cost of up to $5,500\n\nIf you have any more questions or need further clarification, feel free to ask!', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), HumanMessage(content='what is the eligibility criteria?', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), AIMessage(content="### Eligibility Criteria for Walden University Programs\n\n- **Varies by Program**: The eligibility criteria for Walden University's programs differ based on the specific program you are interested in.\n  \n- **Example Criteria**:\n  1. **BS in Business Administration**:\n     - High school diploma or equivalent\n     - 21 years of age or older\n     - Less than 21 years old with at least 12 quarter credits\n     - Active military member or veteran with documentation of service\n\n  2. **BS in Communication**:\n     - Similar criteria may apply\n\n- **Contact Enrollment Specialist**: For personalized information on the eligibility criteria for the program you are interested in, contact an Enrollment Specialist at 844-529-2438.\n\nFeel free to reach out for more details or if you have any other questions.\n\nHave more questions? Feel free to ask!", additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), HumanMessage(content='who are the faculty of BS in Business Administration', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), AIMessage(content='### Faculty of BS in Business Administration at Walden University\n\n1. **Dr. Gary Griffith**\n   - Academic Coordinator in the College of Management and Human Potential\n   - Extensive experience in teaching courses related to information systems management and technology\n\n2. **Dr. Shannon Lynch**\n   - Contributing Faculty Member in the College of Management & Technology\n   - Expertise in Human Resources\n   - Over 21 years of experience at Walden University\n\n3. **Dr. Harry Kemp**\n   - Walden University professor and SCORE mentor\n   - Specializes in business management and disaster preparedness\n\nThese faculty members bring valuable insights and support to the BS in Business Administration program at Walden University.\n\nIf you have any more questions about the faculty or any other aspect of the program, feel free to ask!', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), HumanMessage(content='what is there education', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), AIMessage(content="### Faculty Education for BS in Business Administration Program at Walden University\n\n1. **Dr. Gary Griffith:**\n   - Doctor of Business Administration (DBA)\n   - Specializes in information systems management and technology\n\n2. **Dr. Shannon Lynch:**\n   - Bachelor's in Business Administration (BSBA)\n   - Certified HR Professional through SHRM\n   - Expertise in Human Resources and education\n\n3. **Dr. Harry Kemp:**\n   - Specific education details not provided\n\nIf you need more information about the faculty's education or any other program-related queries, feel free to ask!", additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={})]' for
