ograms like the MS in Data Science at Walden University.\n   - Online programs offer flexibility and accessibility for students.\n\n2. **Relevant Skills and Knowledge**\n   - Gain expertise in big data, predictive analytics, and programming languages (Python, R, SQL).\n   - Strong math background aids in understanding statistical concepts and data analysis.\n\n3. **Program Exploration**\n   - Review the curriculum and admission requirements of the MS in Data Science program.\n   - Ensure alignment with your academic and career goals.\n\nFeel free to reach out if you have any further questions or need additional information!', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), HumanMessage(content='what is the fees for this course?', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), AIMessage(content='### Fees for MS in Data Science Program at Walden University\n\n1. **Tuition**\n   - $565 per quarter hour\n   - Total of $25,425 for 45 quarter credit hours\n\n2. **Program Fee**\n   - $180 per quarter\n   - Total of $900\n\n3. **Total Cost**\n   - $26,325\n\n4. **Believe & Achieve Scholarship**\n   - Reduces tuition by $5,650\n   - Total cost after scholarship: $20,675\n\n5. **Additional Expenses**\n   - Books and materials not included\n   - Additional expense of $1,000 to $1,400\n\nIf you have any more specific questions about the fees or financial aid options for this program, feel free to ask for more information.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={})]' for
